WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.288 --> 00:00:01.786
- [Girl] I hear, that
they're gonna make alcohol

00:00:01.786 --> 00:00:03.446
completely legal in Denver.

00:00:03.446 --> 00:00:04.480
- [Brunette] No way.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.082
And like sell it in Seven11 like weed?

00:00:06.082 --> 00:00:07.149
- Yep.

00:00:07.149 --> 00:00:08.322
- That's crazy.

00:00:08.322 --> 00:00:10.028
- No, I read it in Slate.

00:00:10.028 --> 00:00:11.189
- Is that the guy?

00:00:11.189 --> 00:00:12.281
- [Red Head] Yeah.

00:00:12.281 --> 00:00:13.443
- Looks scary.

00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:15.823
- No, if you just act
cool, then he'll act cool.

00:00:15.823 --> 00:00:17.064
- Hey, you Allison?

00:00:17.064 --> 00:00:18.059
- Yeah.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.859
- Alright.

00:00:20.859 --> 00:00:21.999
Here's a six-pack.

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:25.741
- That's only three bottles.

00:00:25.741 --> 00:00:27.845
- I said here's your six-pack.

00:00:27.845 --> 00:00:28.997
- [Red Head] Run, run!

00:00:30.949 --> 00:00:34.776
- So, what brings you in
for an alcohol prescription?

00:00:34.776 --> 00:00:37.588
- I've just been feeling
like, a little anxious,

00:00:37.588 --> 00:00:39.587
and I've been having
some trouble sleeping.

00:00:39.587 --> 00:00:40.968
- Oh, this'll definitely help.

00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:42.620
Have you medicated before?

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:45.362
- Drink it right?

00:00:45.362 --> 00:00:47.287
- You can drink it, you
could like, guzzle it.

00:00:47.287 --> 00:00:48.878
You could like, get on your hands and put

00:00:48.878 --> 00:00:50.526
it in your mouth, you could do it in like,

00:00:50.526 --> 00:00:52.445
a lot of little glasses.

00:00:52.445 --> 00:00:53.928
You could just kind of
like, figure out what

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:55.298
works for your body.

00:00:55.298 --> 00:00:56.366
- Okay, great.

00:00:56.366 --> 00:00:57.666
- Do you have your license?

00:00:57.666 --> 00:00:58.562
- Yeah, I do.

00:00:58.562 --> 00:01:00.024
- [Doctor] Okay, I trust you.

00:01:00.024 --> 00:01:02.125
Well, you're good to go.

00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:03.286
- Thank you.

00:01:03.286 --> 00:01:04.627
- Take care of yourself.

00:01:04.627 --> 00:01:06.146
- Hey, do you have an alcohol card?

00:01:06.146 --> 00:01:07.319
- Hey, I heard you got a card.

00:01:07.319 --> 00:01:08.562
- Hey.

00:01:08.562 --> 00:01:10.107
I'm having a party this weekend.

00:01:10.107 --> 00:01:12.346
Could you give me a little help?

00:01:12.346 --> 00:01:13.865
- Sure.

00:01:17.611 --> 00:01:20.038
So I just fill this out,
and then I go in and

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.629
they'll give me whatever I want?

00:01:21.629 --> 00:01:22.452
- Yup.

00:01:22.452 --> 00:01:23.508
- Do they take credit cards?

00:01:23.508 --> 00:01:25.052
- Nope. There's an ATM machine with

00:01:25.052 --> 00:01:26.771
a six dollar surcharge.

00:01:26.771 --> 00:01:27.594
- Woof!

00:01:27.594 --> 00:01:29.335
- And no cell phones!

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:37.347
- By God.

00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:38.356
Ma'am.

00:01:38.356 --> 00:01:39.947
- Oh, oh I have a prescription.

00:01:39.947 --> 00:01:40.957
- Doesn't matter, you can't have this much

00:01:40.957 --> 00:01:42.826
in public, this is intent to distribute.

00:01:42.826 --> 00:01:43.987
Let's go.

00:01:43.987 --> 00:01:45.707
- But, I'm a good person.

00:01:45.707 --> 00:01:47.586
- Why don't you just smoke
weed like everyone else?

00:01:47.586 --> 00:01:49.013
It's healthier.

